<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<!-- GT_esmini P8 verification asset (acceptance iv): copy of straight_semantic_stop_sign.xodr
     with the STOP signal marked invalidated="true" (OpenDRIVE 1.9 semantics: a cancelled /
     struck-through regulation). Everything else is byte-identical to the P4 twin. The P8
     invalidated FILTER (D4/D5) removes an invalidated signal from the OSI logical ground
     truth AND from the VirtualDriver route signal scan, so StopYieldSignAware never sees a
     STOP here -> the ego must NOT stop. Used by
     04_traffic_signs/invalidated_stop_sign_ignored.xosc. -->
